Actually, there is a *very* staightforward way that I just
checked out in discovery mode, that should be added to the
spoiler file.

*MAJOR SPOILER*


Wish for a figurine of a gray dragon.  Then apply it.  At least
in pl6 discovery mode, the result is a pet gray dragon.  Really.

The nicest pet I ever got by accident was a jaberwock named
Burbles.  He ate shopkeepers for breakfast.  I also had a ring
of conflict, and he absolutely *decimated* throne rooms and
barracks.  This is a way, given one wish, to have a truly monstrous
pet.  Of course, the problem with this approach is that you never
gain an awful lot of experience yourself.

